The KGW, Gumbel-max (EXP), and SynthID implementations in
src/marktune/baselines/ are adapted from these Apache-2.0 sources:
watermark/kgw/kgw.py
watermark/exp/exp.py
watermark/synthid/synthid.py
watermark/synthid/detector.py

The adapters provide token-based scoring and Hugging Face generation processors.
Gumbel-max uses the equivalent log-domain exponential race. SynthID uses the
configured number of prefix tokens, actual prompt context, and independent
context history for each generation. Framework, visualization, and learned
Bayesian-detector components are not included.
